                <mxCell id="n1" value="Why this is the only diagram with grade branches&#xa;&#xa;render() is the one caller that passes a non-null grade.&#xa;layoutPagesFromHeaders() and decodePageToRgba() both pass&#xa;nullptr, so on those paths every &quot;grade set?&quot; is decided&#xa;before it is asked — which is why their diagrams are shorter&#xa;rather than repetitions of this one." style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;size=14;verticalAlign=top;align=left;spacingLeft=6;" parent="1" vertex="1">
